{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum Guard: Exhibit Unknown</strong> is a short, atmospheric horror game where you take on the role of a lone night guard in a long-forgotten museum. But the artifacts aren\u2019t the only things left behind\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/eb9117d7801a432ba2bbf008bf9451c9.poster.avif?t=1750247215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/eb9117d7801a432ba2bbf008bf9451c9.webm?t=1750247215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/eb9117d7801a432ba2bbf008bf9451c9.mp4?t=1750247215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While completing tasks, explore dark corridors, uncover hidden rooms, and restore lost memories as the museum begins to change around you. Armed only with your flashlight and your instincts, you must survive the night with an exhibit that was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/b3d14b1b2d5c362347ab0c03eecfa4ab.poster.avif?t=1750247215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/b3d14b1b2d5c362347ab0c03eecfa4ab.webm?t=1750247215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/b3d14b1b2d5c362347ab0c03eecfa4ab.mp4?t=1750247215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>Order 13</i>, <i>The Mortuary Assistant</i>, and <i>Phasmophobia.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol the museum after hours\u2026 until the exhibits start moving on their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access areas in any order, but unlocking keys and tools will reveal deeper secrets\u2014and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind is your greatest weapon\u2014and your greatest enemy. Restoring sanity may help\u2026 or hurt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate strange characters, shifting environments, and exhibits that seem to watch you back.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions matter. Will you uncover the full story or be trapped forever in the dark?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/059665cc411ef73510303364afb3f2ae.poster.avif?t=1750247215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/059665cc411ef73510303364afb3f2ae.webm?t=1750247215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/059665cc411ef73510303364afb3f2ae.mp4?t=1750247215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693830?t=1750247215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/d045bb024e81150d08a194fb3cced19055e32d8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750247215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/1bc6bddb0159a6445e1898a0359b1ddac15c4270/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750247215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/1bc6bddb0159a6445e1898a0359b1ddac15c4270/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750247215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Museum Guard: Exhibit Unknown has cigarettes and alcohol to restore sanity. Also, it can include terrifying moments. "},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Museum Guard: Exhibit Unknown</strong> is a short, atmospheric horror game where you take on the role of a lone night guard in a long-forgotten museum. But the artifacts aren\u2019t the only things left behind\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/eb9117d7801a432ba2bbf008bf9451c9.poster.avif?t=1750247215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/eb9117d7801a432ba2bbf008bf9451c9.webm?t=1750247215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693830/extras/eb9117d7801a432ba2bbf008bf9451c9.mp4?t=1750247215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While completing tasks, explore dark corridors, uncover hidden rooms, and restore lost memories as the museum begins to change around you. Armed only with your flashlight and your instincts, you must survive the night with an exhibit that was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a